# ABC-ACCEL A2 memory-group recipe: map-only, no optimization.
# For residuals dominated by flop-memory arrays (wt_dcache_mem /
# cva6_icache tag+valid arrays on cv64a6's WT cache subsystem): even the
# no-scorr tier ran 2h20+ without finishing -- deep AIG restructuring of
# mux-decoded register arrays is where ABC's optimization stages drown,
# and the logic is regular enough that optimization buys little anyway.
# strash + dc2 for cheap cleanup, then straight to the mapper.
strash; dc2
&get -n; &dch; &nf -C 32 -D {period}; &put
strash; &get -n; &nf -D {period}; &put
